{"is_source_file": true, "format": "CMake", "description": "This is a CMake module script (FindLibGlib.cmake) used to locate and configure the GLib library (glib-2.0) within a CMake-based build system. It uses pkg_check_modules to find the library via pkg-config, retrieves various include paths, library paths, and compile/link flags, and provides help messages for debugging. It also defines variables that indicate whether GLib was found and where its components are located.", "external_files": ["PkgConfig"], "external_methods": ["find_package(PkgConfig REQUIRED)", "pkg_check_modules(PC_LIBGLIB QUIET glib-2.0)", "message(STATUS ...)", "find_path(...)", "find_library(...)", "include(FindPackageHandleStandardArgs)", "find_package_handle_standard_args(...)"], "published": ["LIBGLIB_INCLUDE_DIR", "LIBGLIB_CONFIG_INCLUDE_DIR", "LIBGLIB_LIBRARY", "LIBGLIB_INCLUDE_DIRS", "LIBGLIB_LIBRARIES", "PC_LIBGLIB_FOUND", "PC_LIBGLIB_LIBRARIES", "PC_LIBGLIB_LIBRARY_DIRS", "PC_LIBGLIB_LDFLAGs", "PC_LIBGLIB_LDFLAGS_OTHER", "PC_LIBGLIB_INCLUDE_DIRS", "PC_LIBGLIB_CFLAGS", "PC_LIBGLIB_CFLAGS_OTHER", "PC_LIBGLIB_VERSION", "PC_LIBGLIB_PREFIX", "PC_LIBGLIB_INCLUDEDIR", "PC_LIBGLIB_LIBDIR"], "classes": [], "methods": [], "calls": ["find_package(PkgConfig REQUIRED)", "pkg_check_modules(PC_LIBGLIB QUIET glib-2.0)", "message(STATUS ...)", "find_path(...)", "find_library(...)", "include(FindPackageHandleStandardArgs)", "find_package_handle_standard_args(LibGlib DEFAULT_MSG ...)"], "search-terms": ["FindLibGlib", "glib-2.0", "pkg_check_modules", "CMake module", "FindPackageHandleStandardArgs", "libglib", "glib.h"], "state": 2, "file_id": 645, "knowledge_revision": 1910, "git_revision": "0a49fc3c8d2392e4441071755214a10cfd7ccfc0", "hash": "4f7e9495ece246613832dc10195385a9", "format-version": 4, "code-base-name": "Thunder-712", "filename": "cmake/modules/FindLibGlib.cmake", "revision_history": [{"1910": "0a49fc3c8d2392e4441071755214a10cfd7ccfc0"}]}